ountable","wordFamily":["bride dress","dressable","dress down","dressed","dresser","dressing","dressing down","dressing-down","dress off","dress out","dress the part","dress up","field dress","hairdresser","outdress","overdress","redress","undress","undresser","undressing","xdress","hairdress","underdress","Aboyne dress","baby-doll dress","balldress","bandage dress","bathing dress","battledress","bedressed"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dress#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:307499289caf4abd5b","definition":"An item of outer clothing or set of such clothes (worn by people of all sexes) which is generally decorative and appropriate for a particular occasion, profession, etc.","example":"I have been thinking, George, of changing our travelling dreſſes in the morning. I am grown confoundedly aſhamed of mine.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"countable, uncountable","wordFamily":["bride dress","dressable","dress down","dressed","dresser","dressing","dressing down","dressing-down","dress off","dress out","dress the part","dress up","field dress","hairdresser","outdress","overdress","redress","undress","undresser","undressing","xdress","hairdress","underdress","Aboyne dress","baby-doll dress","balldress","bandage dress","bathing dress","battledress","bedressed"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dress#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:afdd0c9c56321fd034","definition":"Ellipsis of dress rehearsal.","example":"","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"abbreviation, alt-of, ellipsis","register":"abbreviation, alt-of, countable, ellipsis, uncountable","wordFamily":["bride dress","dressable","dress down","dressed","dresser","dressing","dressing down","dressing-dow